  "text": "## Step 9: Record Retention & Archive  \n### Document Archival  \n**Records to Archive (6 Years):**\n- Account opening documents (KYC, ID, address verification)\n- All transaction records (statements, transaction log)\n- Account closure request and reason\n- Final statement and balance confirmation\n- Payment proof (receipt, transfer confirmation, check cleared)\n- Any dispute or complaint records  \n**Storage Location:**\n- Secure document management system (DMS)\n- Encrypted, access-controlled\n- Audit trail of all access  \n**Retention Period:** 6 years from closure date (per POCA, AML Regulations)  \n**Destruction Procedure:**\n- At 6-year mark: Schedule for secure destruction\n- Shred paper documents\n- Securely delete digital records\n- Certificate of destruction obtained  \n---",
